r_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_68\">大</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_69\">学</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_70\">院</span> <span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_71\">人</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_72\">間</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_73\">社</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_74\">会</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_75\">シ</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_76\">ス</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_77\">テ</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_78\">ム</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_79\">科</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_80\">学</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_81\">研</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_82\">究</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_83\">科</span><br>\r\n		<span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_84\">現</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_85\">代</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_86\">シ</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_87\">ス</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_88\">テ</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_89\">ム</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_90\">科</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_91\">学</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_92\">専</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_93\">攻</span>\r\n		<span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_94\">知</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_95\">識</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_96\">情</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_97\">報</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_98\">シ</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_99\">ス</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_100\">テ</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_101\">ム</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_102\">学</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_103\">分</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_104\">野</spa