pan><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12136\">い</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12137\">る</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12138\">．</span>\r\n	</p>\r\n\r\n	<p>\r\n			<span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12139\">指</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12140\">針</span>\r\n			<span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12141\">2</span> <span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12142\">に</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12143\">お</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12144\">い</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12145\">て</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12146\">，</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12147\">問</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12148\">い</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12149\">の</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12150\">概</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12151\">念</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12152\">を</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12153\">，</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12154\">「</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12155\">行</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12156\">動</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12157\">」</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12158\">，</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12159\">「</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12160\">認</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12161\">知</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12162\">活</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12163\">動</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12164\">」</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12165\">，</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12166\">「</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12167\">メ</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12168\">タ</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12169\">認</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12170\">知</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12171\">活</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12172\">動</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12173\">」</span>\r\n			<span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12174\">の</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12175\">大</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12176\">き</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12177\">く</span> <span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12178\">4</span> <span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12179\">つ</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12180\">に</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12181\">分</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12182\">類</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12183\">し</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12184\">て</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12185\">い</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12186\">る</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12187\">．</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12188\">以</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12189\">下</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12190\">，</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12191\">こ</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12192\">れ</span> <span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12193\">ら</span> <span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12194\">4</span> <span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12195\">つ</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12196\">の</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12197\">概</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12198\">念</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12199\">が</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12200\">何</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12201\">に</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12202\">基</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12203\">づ</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12204\">い</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12205\">て</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12206\">，</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12207\">具</span>\r\n			<span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12208\">体</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12209\">的</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12210\">に</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12211\">ど</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12212\">の</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12213\">よ</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12214\">う</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12215\">な</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12216\">概</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12217\">念</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12218\">を</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12219\">定</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12220\">義</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12221\">し</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12222\">て</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12223\">い</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12224\">る</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12225\">か</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12226\">に</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12227\">つ</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12228\">い</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12229\">て</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12230\">説</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12231\">明</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12232\">す</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12233\">る</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12234\">．</span>\r\n			</p><ul>\r\n				<li>\r\n						行動 ：研究活動において，実際に行動として表れる活動を規定してお\r\n						り，行動の概念には「書く，読む，システムを実装する」等を定義し\r\n						ている．\r\n				</li>\r\n				<li>\r\n						メタ認知活動 ：田中ら [17 が提唱する批判的思考の特徴を参考にした．\r\n						メタ認知活動の概念には「取り組む意義がある問題か考える，システ\r\n						ムに落とし込めるか考える，他の選択肢を考える」等を定義している．\r\n				</li>\r\n				<li>\r\n						認知活動 ：研究領域横断的な概念は内田 [18 の仮説思考法を参考とし，\r\n						研究領域（教育システム情報 学分野）に特化した概念は，溝口 [19 が\r\n						提示する知的教育システムに必要な構成要素を参考に規定している．\r\n						認知活動の概念には，「研究目的を考える，解決手法を考える，実践デ\r\n						ザインを考える」等を定義している．\r\n				</li>\r\n				<li>\r\n						成果物 ：上記 3 つの活動を通して生み出される結果を規定している．\r\n						具体的には，「研究目的，対象者，システムデザイン」などを定義して\r\n						いる．\r\n				</li>\r\n			</ul>\r\n	<p></p>\r\n	<p>\r\n			<span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12235\">上</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12236\">記</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12237\">の</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12238\">分</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12239\">類</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12240\">に</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12241\">基</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12242\">づ</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12243\">い</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12244\">て</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12245\">，</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12246\">指</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12247\">針</span>\r\n			<span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12248\">3</span> <span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12249\">で</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12250\">は</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12251\">，</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12252\">問</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12253\">い</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12254\">概</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12255\">念</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12256\">の</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12257\">部</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12258\">分</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12259\">概</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12260\">念</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12261\">と</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12262\">し</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12263\">て</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12264\">「</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12265\">サ</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12266\">ブ</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12267\">活</span>\r\n			<span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12268\">動</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12269\">」</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12270\">，</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12271\">「</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12272\">入</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12273\">力</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12274\">」</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12275\">，</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12276\">「</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12277\">出</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12278\">力</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12279\">」</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12280\">を</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12281\">規</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12282\">定</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12283\">し</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12284\">て</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12285\">い</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12286\">る</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12287\">．</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12288\">以</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12289\">下</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12290\">，</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12291\">各</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12292\">部</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12293\">分</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12294\">概</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12295\">念</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12296\">の</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12297\">役</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12298\">割</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12299\">に</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12300\">つ</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12301\">い</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12302\">て</span>\r\n			<span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12303\">述</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12304\">べ</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12305\">る</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12306\">．</span>\r\n			</p><ul>\r\n				<li>\r\n						サブ活動 ：とは，ある活動を達 成するために必要な活動を指す．例え\r\n						ば，「実践デザインについて考える」という思考活動を行う場合，サブ\r\n						活動として「実践目的を考える，実践仮説を考える，実践手順を考え\r\n						る，実践の理想の結果を考える」を定義している．\r\n				</li>\r\n				<li>\r\n						入力 ：ある思考活動を考える際に必要な概念を規定している\r\n				</li>\r\n				<li>\r\n						出力 ：思考活動によって生み出される結果の概念を規定している\r\n						これらを規定することにより，例えば，「システムデザインを考える」と\r\n						いう概念の入力に「解決手法」が，出力に「システム デザイン」を定義し\r\n						た場合，入力及び出力を起点に問い概念の関係が構築さ れる （図 5.2\r\n				</li>\r\n			</ul>\r\n	<p></p>\r\n	<p>\r\n			<span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12307\">こ</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12308\">の</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12309\">よ</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12310\">う</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12311\">に</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12312\">オ</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12313\">ン</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12314\">ト</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12315\">ロ</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12316\">ジ</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12317\">ー</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12318\">を</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12319\">設</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12320\">計</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12321\">す</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12322\">る</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12323\">こ</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12324\">と</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12325\">で</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12326\">，</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12327\">サ</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12328\">ブ</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12329\">活</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12330\">動</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12331\">及</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12332\">び</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12333\">入</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12334\">出</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12335\">力</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12336\">の</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12337\">属</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12338\">性</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12339\">に</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12340\">基</span>\r\n			<span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12341\">づ</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12342\">い</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12343\">て</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12344\">，</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12345\">概</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12346\">念</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12347\">間</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12348\">を</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12349\">対</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12350\">応</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12351\">付</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12352\">け</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12353\">る</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12354\">こ</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12355\">と</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12356\">が</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12357\">可</span><span class=\"paper_txt_obj\" id=\"p_txt_12358\">能</span><span class=\"paper_txt